{
  "name": "Weather desk - three-city Discord briefing",
  "description": "Post a three-city weather briefing to Discord. Setup: edit Weather settings (city names, coordinates and thresholds); choose a Discord credential on Post weather to Discord. Add it under Credentials → Discord channel webhook using the URL copied from Discord Server settings → Integrations → Webhooks. Save and Run workflow with {} for a one-time test. For daily delivery, activate this Webhook workflow, generate its key in Settings and schedule an authenticated POST to its endpoint. Messages must fit 2000 characters. This sends channel messages; it does not read Discord messages.",
